; Original ART boot/signing chain under inherited Linux NNP1.
; Actual325 denies init -> art_boot process2:nnp_transition. All four
; original process transitions/entrypoints already exist in policy65.
; Preserve NNP1, original executable labels, credentials and capabilities.
; No execute_no_trans, file, Binder, device or capability grant.
; profman is not an original odrefresh transition; do not invent it.
(allow init art_boot (process2 (nnp_transition)))
(allow init odsign (process2 (nnp_transition)))
(allow odsign odrefresh (process2 (nnp_transition)))
(allow odrefresh dex2oat (process2 (nnp_transition)))
